      <h3 id="migrating-between-capi-mapi_cluster-api-disabling" class="group scroll-mt-20">Migrating a Cluster API resource to use the Machine API<a href="#migrating-between-capi-mapi_cluster-api-disabling" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <p class="_abstract">You can migrate individual Cluster API objects to equivalent Machine API objects.</p>
