      </li>
      <li>
      Edit the resource specification by running the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc edit <resource_kind>/<resource_name> -n openshift-machine-api"} lang="terminal" />
      <p>where:</p>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
