      <p>where:</p>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>kind</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the resource kind of the resource that you want to migrate. For example, the resource kind for a compute machine set is <code>MachineSet</code> and the resource kind for a compute machine is <code>Machine</code>.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>metadata.name</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the name of the resource that you want to migrate.</p></dd>
